---
description: "Cursor overlay for FastAPI/Python app files. Canonical rules live in AGENTS.md."
globs:
  - "app/**/*.py"
  - "alembic/**/*.py"
  - "tests/**/*.py"
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow root `AGENTS.md` for this stack.

When editing matching files:

- Keep FastAPI routers thin; put domain logic in `app/services/`.
- Use async SQLAlchemy 2.x patterns; do not block the event loop.
- Validate request/response bodies with Pydantic v2 models.
- Add or update Alembic migrations when models change.
- Prefer typed functions everywhere under `app/`.
